    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17c5ce85b32525b2b413a529",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是目白麦昆轻轻摇着尾巴离开了。\n她似乎稍微对我敞开了心房。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64bd80fd410780beff6d434a0ff10fa77a945bc13eaeace63243f3a90d6c06f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
